  "vv84:0.3": "",
  "vv84:0.4": "10. Serīsakavimānavatthu 1228. ",
  "vv84:1.1": "Suṇotha yakkhassa ca vāṇijāna ca, ",
  "vv84:1.2": "samāgamo yattha tadā ahosi; ",
  "vv84:1.3": "Yathā kathaṃ itaritarena cāpi, ",
  "vv84:1.4": "subhāsitaṃ tañca suṇātha sabbe. ",
  "vv84:2.1": "1229. ‘‘Yo so ahu rājā pāyāsi nāma , ",
  "vv84:2.2": "bhummānaṃ sahabyagato yasassī; ",
  "vv84:2.3": "So modamānova sake vimāne, ",
  "vv84:2.4": "amānuso mānuse ajjhabhāsīti. ",
  "vv84:3.1": "1230. ‘‘Vaṅke araññe amanussaṭṭhāne, ",
  "vv84:3.2": "kantāre appodake appabhakkhe; ",
  "vv84:3.3": "Suduggame vaṇṇupathassa majjhe, ",
  "vv84:3.4": "vaṅkaṃ bhayā naṭṭhamanā manussā. ",
  "vv84:4.1": "1231. ‘‘Nayidha phalā mūlamayā ca santi, ",
  "vv84:4.2": "upādānaṃ natthi kutodha bhakkho; ",
  "vv84:4.3": "Aññatra paṃsūhi ca vālukāhi ca, ",
  "vv84:4.4": "tatāhi uṇhāhi ca dāruṇāhi ca. ",
  "vv84:5.1": "1232. ‘‘Ujjaṅgalaṃ tattamivaṃ kapālaṃ, ",
  "vv84:5.2": "anāyasaṃ paralokena tulyaṃ; ",
  "vv84:5.3": "Luddānamāvāsamidaṃ purāṇaṃ, ",
  "vv84:5.4": "bhūmippadeso abhisattarūpo. ",
  "vv84:6.1": "1233. ‘‘Atha tumhe kena vaṇṇena, ",
  "vv84:6.2": "kimāsamānā imaṃ padesaṃ hi; ",
  "vv84:6.3": "Anupaviṭṭhā sahasā samecca, ",
  "vv84:6.4": "lobhā bhayā atha vā sampamūḷhā’’ti. ",
  "vv84:7.1": "1234. ‘‘Magadhesu aṅgesu ca satthavāhā, ",
  "vv84:7.2": "āropayitvā paṇiyaṃ puthuttaṃ; ",
  "vv84:7.3": "Te yāmase sindhusovīrabhūmiṃ, ",
  "vv84:7.4": "dhanatthikā uddayaṃ patthayānā. ",
  "vv84:8.1": "1235. ‘‘Divā pipāsaṃ nadhivāsayantā, ",
  "vv84:8.2": "yoggānukampañca samekkhamānā, ",
  "vv84:8.3": "Etena vegena āyāma sabbe , ",
  "vv84:8.4": "rattiṃ maggaṃ paṭipannā vikāle. ",
  "vv84:9.1": "1236. ‘‘Te duppayātā aparaddhamaggā, ",
  "vv84:9.2": "andhākulā vippanaṭṭhā araññe; ",
  "vv84:9.3": "Suduggame vaṇṇupathassa majjhe, ",
  "vv84:9.4": "disaṃ na jānāma pamūḷhacittā. ",
  "vv84:10.1": "1237. ‘‘Idañca disvāna adiṭṭhapubbaṃ, ",
  "vv84:10.2": "vimānaseṭṭhañca tavañca yakkha; ",
  "vv84:10.3": "Tatuttariṃ jīvitamāsamānā, ",
  "vv84:10.4": "disvā patītā sumanā udaggā’’ti. ",
  "vv84:11.1": "1238. ‘‘Pāraṃ samuddassa imañca vaṇṇuṃ , ",
  "vv84:11.2": "vettācaraṃ saṅkupathañca maggaṃ; ",
  "vv84:11.3": "Nadiyo pana pabbatānañca duggā, ",
  "vv84:11.4": "puthuddisā gacchatha bhogahetu. ",
  "vv84:12.1": "1239. ‘‘Pakkhandiyāna vijitaṃ paresaṃ, ",
  "vv84:12.2": "verajjake mānuse pekkhamānā; ",
  "vv84:12.3": "Yaṃ vo sutaṃ vā atha vāpi diṭṭhaṃ, ",
  "vv84:12.4": "accherakaṃ taṃ vo suṇoma tātā’’ti. ",
  "vv84:13.1": "1240. ‘‘Itopi accherataraṃ kumāra, ",
  "vv84:13.2": "na to sutaṃ vā atha vāpi diṭṭhaṃ; ",
  "vv84:13.3": "Atītamānussakameva sabbaṃ, ",
  "vv84:13.4": "disvāna tappāma anomavaṇṇaṃ. ",
  "vv84:14.1": "1241. ‘‘Vehāyasaṃ pokkharañño savanti, ",
  "vv84:14.2": "pahūtamalyā bahupuṇḍarīkā; ",
  "vv84:14.3": "Dumā cime niccaphalūpapannā, ",
  "vv84:14.4": "atīva gandhā surabhiṃ pavāyanti. ",
  "vv84:15.1": "1242. ‘‘Veḷūriyathambhā satamussitāse, ",
  "vv84:15.2": "silāpavāḷassa ca āyataṃsā; ",
  "vv84:15.3": "Masāragallā sahalohitaṅgā, ",
  "vv84:15.4": "thambhā ime jotirasāmayāse. ",
  "vv84:16.1": "1243. ‘‘Sahassathambhaṃ atulānubhāvaṃ, ",
  "vv84:16.2": "tesūpari sādhumidaṃ vimānaṃ; ",
  "vv84:16.3": "Ratanantaraṃ kañcanavedimissaṃ, ",
  "vv84:16.4": "tapanīyapaṭṭehi ca sādhuchannaṃ. ",
  "vv84:17.1": "1244. ‘‘Jambonaduttattamidaṃ sumaṭṭho, ",
  "vv84:17.2": "pāsādasopāṇaphalūpapanno; ",
  "vv84:17.3": "Daḷho ca vaggu ca susaṅgato ca , ",
  "vv84:17.4": "atīva nijjhānakhamo manuñño. ",
  "vv84:18.1": "1245. ‘‘Ratanantarasmiṃ bahuannapānaṃ, ",
  "vv84:18.2": "parivārito accharāsaṅgaṇena; ",
  "vv84:18.3": "Murajaālambaratūriyaghuṭṭho, ",
  "vv84:18.4": "abhivanditosi thutivandanāya. ",
  "vv84:19.1": "1246. ‘‘So modasi nārigaṇappabodhano, ",
  "vv84:19.2": "vimānapāsādavare manorame; ",
  "vv84:19.3": "Acintiyo sabbaguṇūpapanno, ",
  "vv84:19.4": "rājā yathā vessavaṇo naḷinyā . ",
  "vv84:20.1": "1247. ‘‘Devo nu āsi udavāsi yakkho, ",
  "vv84:20.2": "udāhu devindo manussabhūto; ",
  "vv84:20.3": "Pucchanti taṃ vāṇijā satthavāhā, ",
  "vv84:20.4": "ācikkha ko nāma tuvaṃsi yakkho’’ti. ",
  "vv84:21.1": "1248. ‘‘Serīsako nāma ahamhi yakkho, ",
  "vv84:21.2": "kantāriyo vaṇṇupathamhi gutto; ",
  "vv84:21.3": "Imaṃ padesaṃ abhipālayāmi, ",
  "vv84:21.4": "vacanakaro vessavaṇassa rañño’’ti. ",
  "vv84:22.1": "1249. ‘‘Adhiccaladdhaṃ pariṇāmajaṃ te, ",
  "vv84:22.2": "sayaṃ kataṃ udāhu devehi dinnaṃ; ",
  "vv84:22.3": "Pucchanti taṃ vāṇijā satthavāhā, ",
  "vv84:22.4": "kathaṃ tayā laddhamidaṃ manuñña’’nti. ",
  "vv84:23.1": "1250. ‘‘Nādhiccaladdhaṃ na pariṇāmajaṃ me, ",
  "vv84:23.2": "na sayaṃ kataṃ na hi devehi dinnaṃ; ",
  "vv84:23.3": "Sakehi kammehi apāpakehi, ",
  "vv84:23.4": "puññehi me laddhamidaṃ manuñña’’nti. ",
  "vv84:24.1": "1251. ‘‘Kiṃ te vataṃ kiṃ pana brahmacariyaṃ, ",
  "vv84:24.2": "kissa suciṇṇassa ayaṃ vipāko; ",
  "vv84:24.3": "Pucchanti taṃ vāṇijā satthavāhā, ",
  "vv84:24.4": "kathaṃ tayā laddhamidaṃ vimāna’’nti. ",
  "vv84:25.1": "1252. ‘‘Mamaṃ pāyāsīti ahu samaññā, ",
  "vv84:25.2": "rajjaṃ yadā kārayiṃ kosalānaṃ; ",
  "vv84:25.3": "Natthikadiṭṭhi kadariyo pāpadhammo, ",
  "vv84:25.4": "ucchedavādī ca tadā ahosiṃ. ",
  "vv84:26.1": "1253. ‘‘Samaṇo ca kho āsi kumārakassapo, ",
  "vv84:26.2": "bahussuto cittakathī uḷāro; ",
  "vv84:26.3": "So me tadā dhammakathaṃ abhāsi , ",
  "vv84:26.4": "diṭṭhivisūkāni vinodayī me. ",
  "vv84:27.1": "1254. ‘‘Tāhaṃ tassa dhammakathaṃ suṇitvā, ",
  "vv84:27.2": "upāsakattaṃ paṭivedayissaṃ; ",
  "vv84:27.3": "Pāṇātipātā virato ahosiṃ, ",
  "vv84:27.4": "loke adinnaṃ parivajjayissaṃ; ",
  "vv84:27.5": "Amajjapo no ca musā abhāṇiṃ, ",
  "vv84:27.6": "sakena dārena ca ahosi tuṭṭho. ",
  "vv84:28.1": "1255. ‘‘Taṃ me vataṃ taṃ pana brahmacariyaṃ, ",
  "vv84:28.2": "tassa suciṇṇassa ayaṃ vipāko; ",
  "vv84:28.3": "Teheva kammehi apāpakehi, ",
  "vv84:28.4": "puññehi me laddhamidaṃ vimāna’’nti. ",
  "vv84:29.1": "1256. ‘‘Saccaṃ kirāhaṃsu narā sapaññā, ",
  "vv84:29.2": "anaññathā vacanaṃ paṇḍitānaṃ; ",
  "vv84:29.3": "Yahiṃ yahiṃ gacchati puññakammo, ",
  "vv84:29.4": "tahiṃ tahiṃ modati kāmakāmī. ",
  "vv84:30.1": "1257. ‘‘Yahiṃ yahiṃ sokapariddavo ca, ",
  "vv84:30.2": "vadho ca bandho ca parikkileso; ",
  "vv84:30.3": "Tahiṃ tahiṃ gacchati pāpakammo, ",
  "vv84:30.4": "na muccati duggatiyā kadācī’’ti. ",
  "vv84:31.1": "1258. ‘‘Sammūḷharūpova jano ahosi, ",
  "vv84:31.2": "asmiṃ muhutte kalalīkatova; ",
  "vv84:31.3": "Janassimassa tuyhañca kumāra, ",
  "vv84:31.4": "appaccayo kena nu kho ahosī’’ti. ",
  "vv84:32.1": "1259. ‘‘Ime ca sirīsavanā tātā, ",
  "vv84:32.2": "dibbā gandhā surabhī sampavanti ; ",
  "vv84:32.3": "Te sampavāyanti imaṃ vimānaṃ, ",
  "vv84:32.4": "divā ca ratto ca tamaṃ nihantvā. ",
  "vv84:33.1": "1260. ‘‘Imesañca kho vassasataccayena, ",
  "vv84:33.2": "sipāṭikā phalati ekamekā; ",
  "vv84:33.3": "Mānussakaṃ vassasataṃ atītaṃ, ",
  "vv84:33.4": "yadagge kāyamhi idhūpapanno. ",
  "vv84:34.1": "1261. ‘‘Disvānahaṃ vassasatāni pañca, ",
  "vv84:34.2": "asmiṃ vimāne ṭhatvāna tātā; ",
  "vv84:34.3": "Āyukkhayā puññakkhayā cavissaṃ, ",
  "vv84:34.4": "teneva sokena pamucchitosmī’’ti . ",
  "vv84:35.1": "1262. ‘‘Kathaṃ nu soceyya tathāvidho so, ",
  "vv84:35.2": "laddhā vimānaṃ atulaṃ cirāya; ",
  "vv84:35.3": "Ye cāpi kho ittaramupapannā, ",
  "vv84:35.4": "te nūna soceyyuṃ parittapuññā’’ti. ",
  "vv84:36.1": "1263. ‘‘Anucchaviṃ ovadiyañca me taṃ, ",
  "vv84:36.2": "yaṃ maṃ tumhe peyyavācaṃ vadetha; ",
  "vv84:36.3": "Tumhe ca kho tātā mayānuguttā, ",
  "vv84:36.4": "yenicchakaṃ tena paletha sotthi’’nti. ",
  "vv84:37.1": "1264. ‘‘Gantvā mayaṃ sindhusovīrabhūmiṃ, ",
  "vv84:37.2": "dhanatthikā uddayaṃ patthayānā; ",
  "vv84:37.3": "Yathāpayogā paripuṇṇacāgā, ",
  "vv84:37.4": "kāhāma serīsamahaṃ uḷāra’’nti. ",
  "vv84:38.1": "1265. ‘‘Mā ceva serīsamahaṃ akattha, ",
  "vv84:38.2": "sabbañca vo bhavissati yaṃ vadetha; ",
  "vv84:38.3": "Pāpāni kammāni vivajjayātha, ",
  "vv84:38.4": "dhammānuyogañca adhiṭṭhahātha. ",
  "vv84:39.1": "1266. ‘‘Upāsako atthi imamhi saṅghe, ",
  "vv84:39.2": "bahussuto sīlavatūpapanno; ",
  "vv84:39.3": "Saddho ca cāgī ca supesalo ca, ",
  "vv84:39.4": "vicakkhaṇo santusito mutīmā. ",
  "vv84:40.1": "1267. ‘‘Sañjānamāno na musā bhaṇeyya, ",
  "vv84:40.2": "parūpaghātāya na cetayeyya; ",
  "vv84:40.3": "Vebhūtikaṃ pesuṇaṃ no kareyya, ",
  "vv84:40.4": "saṇhañca vācaṃ sakhilaṃ bhaṇeyya. ",
  "vv84:41.1": "1268. ‘‘Sagāravo sappaṭisso vinīto, ",
  "vv84:41.2": "apāpako adhisīle visuddho; ",
  "vv84:41.3": "So mātaraṃ pitarañcāpi jantu, ",
  "vv84:41.4": "dhammena poseti ariyavutti. ",
  "vv84:42.1": "1269. ‘‘Maññe so mātāpitūnaṃ kāraṇā, ",
  "vv84:42.2": "bhogāni pariyesati na attahetu; ",
  "vv84:42.3": "Mātāpitūnañca yo accayena, ",
  "vv84:42.4": "nekkhammapoṇo carissati brahmacariyaṃ. ",
  "vv84:43.1": "1270. ‘‘Ujū avaṅko asaṭho amāyo, ",
  "vv84:43.2": "na lesakappena ca vohareyya; ",
  "vv84:43.3": "So tādiso sukatakammakārī, ",
  "vv84:43.4": "dhamme ṭhito kinti labhetha dukkhaṃ. ",
  "vv84:44.1": "1271. ‘‘Taṃ kāraṇā pātukatomhi attanā, ",
  "vv84:44.2": "tasmā dhammaṃ passatha vāṇijāse; ",
  "vv84:44.3": "Aññatra teniha bhasmī bhavetha, ",
  "vv84:44.4": "andhākulā vippanaṭṭhā araññe; ",
  "vv84:44.5": "Taṃ khippamānena lahuṃ parena, ",
  "vv84:44.6": "sukho have sappurisena saṅgamo’’ti. ",
  "vv84:45.1": "1272. ‘‘Kiṃ nāma so kiñca karoti kammaṃ, ",
  "vv84:45.2": "Kiṃ nāmadheyyaṃ kiṃ pana tassa gottaṃ; ",
  "vv84:45.3": "Mayampi naṃ daṭṭhukāmamha yakkha, ",
  "vv84:45.4": "yassānukampāya idhāgatosi; ",
  "vv84:45.5": "Lābhā hi tassa, yassa tuvaṃ pihesī’’ti. ",
  "vv84:46.1": "1273. ‘‘Yo kappako sambhavanāmadheyyo, ",
  "vv84:46.2": "Upāsako kocchaphalūpajīvī; ",
  "vv84:46.3": "Jānātha naṃ tumhākaṃ pesiyo so, ",
  "vv84:46.4": "Mā kho naṃ hīḷittha supesalo so’’ti. ",
  "vv84:47.1": "1274. ‘‘Jānāmase yaṃ tvaṃ pavadesi yakkha, ",
  "vv84:47.2": "Na kho naṃ jānāma sa edisoti; ",
  "vv84:47.3": "Mayampi naṃ pūjayissāma yakkha, ",
  "vv84:47.4": "Sutvāna tuyhaṃ vacanaṃ uḷāra’’nti. ",
  "vv84:48.1": "1275. ‘‘Ye keci imasmiṃ satthe manussā, ",
  "vv84:48.2": "Daharā mahantā athavāpi majjhimā; ",
  "vv84:48.3": "Sabbeva te ālambantu vimānaṃ, ",
  "vv84:48.4": "Passantu puññānaṃ phalaṃ kadariyā’’ti. ",
  "vv84:49.1": "1276. Te tattha sabbeva ‘ahaṃ pure’ti, ",
  "vv84:49.2": "Taṃ kappakaṃ tattha purakkhatvā ; ",
  "vv84:49.3": "Sabbeva te ālambiṃsu vimānaṃ, ",
  "vv84:49.4": "Masakkasāraṃ viya vāsavassa. ",
  "vv84:50.1": "1277. Te tattha sabbeva ‘ahaṃ pure’ti, ",
  "vv84:50.2": "upāsakattaṃ paṭivedayiṃsu; ",
  "vv84:50.3": "Pāṇātipātā viratā ahesuṃ, ",
  "vv84:50.4": "loke adinnaṃ parivajjayiṃsu; ",
  "vv84:50.5": "Amajjapā no ca musā bhaṇiṃsu, ",
  "vv84:50.6": "sakena dārena ca ahesuṃ tuṭṭhā. ",
  "vv84:51.1": "1278. Te tattha sabbeva ‘ahaṃ pure’ti, ",
  "vv84:51.2": "upāsakattaṃ paṭivedayitvā; ",
  "vv84:51.3": "Pakkāmi sattho anumodamāno, ",
  "vv84:51.4": "yakkhiddhiyā anumato punappunaṃ. ",
  "vv84:52.1": "1279. ‘‘Gantvāna te sindhusovīrabhūmiṃ, ",
  "vv84:52.2": "dhanatthikā uddayaṃ patthayānā; ",
  "vv84:52.3": "Yathāpayogā paripuṇṇalābhā, ",
  "vv84:52.4": "paccāgamuṃ pāṭaliputtamakkhataṃ. ",
  "vv84:53.1": "1280. ‘‘Gantvāna te saṅgharaṃ sotthivanto, ",
  "vv84:53.2": "Puttehi dārehi samaṅgibhūtā; ",
  "vv84:53.3": "Ānandī vittā sumanā patītā, ",
  "vv84:53.4": "Akaṃsu serīsamahaṃ uḷāraṃ; ",
  "vv84:53.5": "Serīsakaṃ te pariveṇaṃ māpayiṃsu. ",
  "vv84:54.1": "1281. Etādisā sappurisāna sevanā, ",
  "vv84:54.2": "Mahatthikā dhammaguṇāna sevanā; ",
  "vv84:54.3": "Ekassa atthāya upāsakassa, ",
  "vv84:54.4": "Sabbeva sattā sukhitā ahesunti. ",
  "vv84:55.1": "Serīsakavimānaṃ dasamaṃ. "
}
